{'name': 'Brasil Arts Cafe', 'address': '1230 State St, Ste C', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Juice Bars & Smoothies, Breakfast & Brunch, Brazilian, Restaurants, Food, Salad, Acai Bowls', 'hours': {'Monday': '17:0-20:30', 'Thursday': '17:0-20:30', 'Friday': '17:0-20:30', 'Saturday': '10:0-21:0', 'Sunday': '10:0-16:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': False, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': True, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': True, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-21 06:50:22', 'review_text': "Our hosts Roberta and Mestre Daniel Yoshimi (aka Prof. Chin) provided an excellent menu of the favorite foods of Brazil (o Brasil, em português). One who appreciates tasty-good food simply cannot stay away very long. My tri tip was delicious, and the multiple traditional sides were exactly on-point. (Prices are friendly too.)

I used to visit this establishment weekly to take part in great African drumming classes, and it's fun to revisit the festive atmosphere and food. They present their cuisine and culture with hospitality, nuance and great cooking skills.

#HighlyRecommended"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-18 05:28:16', 'review_text': 'my boyfriend and I went here for dinner and it was a nice experience :) we each got a caipirinha to drink which was good and my boyfriend LOVED the stroganoff! My Brazilian cesar was good and the brigadiero which we got to go was AMAZING! I would go back to try more! The lady told us to make ourselves at home which was a sweet sentiment!! The people were very nice :,)'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-15 12:06:28', 'review_text': 'The restaurant facility itself may not look all that elegant and appealing but the service and the food really blows that away. They serve food for each meal of the day but I personally would recommend going for breakfast and trying one of their acai fruit bowls. Slightly on the pricier side but so worth it and you will be healthily full for hours to come! The culture here is also something that is unique and interesting. Great place for family brunch!'}]}

{'name': "Mama's Bakery & Deli", 'address': '5342 Hollister Ave', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Food, Delis, Bakeries', 'hours': {'Monday': '6:0-16:30', 'Tuesday': '6:0-16:30', 'Wednesday': '6:0-16:30', 'Thursday': '6:0-16:30', 'Friday': '6:0-16:30'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'valet': False, 'garage': False, 'street': True, 'lot': True, 'validated': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': None, 'OutdoorSeating': None, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': None, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2017-04-14 17:12:21', 'review_text': "Solid Banh Mi sandwiches at a decent price. It's not San Francisco, but it will have to do.it work ld be nice if their bread was crispier and if they had lemongrass pork"}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2017-03-24 23:17:39', 'review_text': "Really hard to spot out, but I'm glad I found it! I would've never expected this to be a business that served pho and banh mi if I just drove by it, but I'm glad curiosity got the best of me and I'd like to try this place more often. 

I ordered half a pork banh mi with everything on it and it was reminiscent of the Vietnamese spots in the east bay suburbs. My only complaint is their bread isn't as flaky and it's more soft and dense, but it does the job for a craving. They didn't skimp out on the pork which is good. 

The lady running the counter was really nice and I got my sandwich way faster than I'd expect anywhere else in this area. Worth it!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2017-03-15 18:18:55', 'review_text': "Freshest sandwich in town. The bread is so soft and the ingredients are so fresh. Never greasy, light yet filling. So delicious! My favorite is the pastrami, it's the Wednesday special. If you like your sandwich with everything make sure you let them know or they won't put condiments on it. Must try!"}]}

{'name': "Chad's", 'address': '216 W Cabrillo Blvd', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Diners, Salad, American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants', 'hours': {'Monday': '7:0-14:30', 'Tuesday': '7:0-14:30', 'Wednesday': '7:0-14:30', 'Thursday': '7:0-14:30', 'Friday': '7:0-14:30', 'Saturday': '7:0-14:30', 'Sunday': '7:0-14:30'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': None, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': None, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': True, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-19 02:02:14', 'review_text': "The absolute BEST eggs benedict (the Californian) that I've ever had.  From the light slightly lemony sauce (not thick and gelatinous) to the soft perfect muffin and am ample perfect amount of spinach ... PERFECT.  JUST PERFECT.

The mimosa flight was stunning as well!

Thanks Chads - we will be back."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-16 21:30:42', 'review_text': "This place is magical!!!  I would like to give this establishment 10 Stars. We arrived to meet an anticipated Sunday Brunch crowd. The magic begins here! As we waited under the sun blocking covering, we listened to great music over Bose speakers!!! We swayed and enjoyed the day. The owner, Chad, served us delightful muffins and thanked us for coming out then... Mark, the magician, gave us an AWESOME  show!!! Kiri, our waitress, was superior and this place was a WHOLE EXPERIENCE. The food is DELICIOUS!  Visit Chad's! You deserve the best!!!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-16 19:45:18', 'review_text': "We had breakfast at Chad's this morning and it did not disappoint. We were appreciative and impressed by their attentive service and delicious food. Their complimentary mini muffins to start are so good! We love Chad and everything he brings to our community. Thank you!"}]}

{'name': "Alphie's Restaurant", 'address': '5725 Hollister Ave', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Burgers, American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Diners', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '6:0-14:0', 'Wednesday': '6:0-14:0', 'Thursday': '6:0-14:0', 'Friday': '6:0-14:0', 'Saturday': '6:0-14:0', 'Sunday': '6:0-14:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': False, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': None, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 3.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2020-03-21 20:01:31', 'review_text': 'Ordered breakfast takeout today for 6 family members.  Everyone was very happy and enjoyed the food.  Thank you for the experience...looking forward to trying lunch items too!'}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2020-02-08 19:14:08', 'review_text': "If you want a hardy breakfast at a good price, then this is it! 

I'd go back for the food as it was very good!

Service...not so much."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2019-11-18 10:50:57', 'review_text': "I'm glad we found this hole-in-the-wall! My friends and I were visiting UCSB from out of town for the weekend and we were looking for a breakfast place before the long trip back home. This place has a cozy atmosphere and I was surprised that there was a live band playing. I ordered the crab omelette and my sister ordered the Loco Moco that they had as one of the day's specials. Both dishes were tasty and hearty, plus reasonably priced. I love how filled the omelette was and how the cheese from inside the omelette would stretch from every forkful! Even the food that my friends ordered looked delicious. The service was also pretty good. Definitely would come again when we come back to visit UCSB."}]}

{'name': 'Blenders In the Grass', 'address': '1046 Coast Village Rd, Ste F', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Juice Bars & Smoothies, Food, Restaurants, Vegetarian', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '7:0-22:0', 'Wednesday': '7:0-22:0', 'Thursday': '7:0-22:0', 'Friday': '7:0-18:0', 'Saturday': '8:0-22:0', 'Sunday': '8:0-22:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'valet': False, 'garage': False, 'street': None, 'lot': True, 'validated': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': False, 'WiFi': 'no', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'classy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'touristy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 3.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-09 04:23:38', 'review_text': 'I went to blenders and ordered 2 drinks.  One was a blue pomegranate and it was made short even after using the spatula to pour any excess smoothie into the cup. I know the smoothie is supposed to reach the top of the cup because I used to be a supervisor there. This is not the first time this has happened, it seems to be a reoccurring problem.'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-09-21 16:07:13', 'review_text': 'The blenders in montecito last night I go to the register the girl working it goes to it too and just blankly stares at me.

No hello what can I get you no acknowledgment or greeting. I have to initiate my order.'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-05-17 20:01:12', 'review_text': 'If you like added sugar in their ice milk and sherbet and non organic gmo tasting fruit and soy milk then this is your place! The fruit juice they add tastes like corn syrup and sugar, maybe 10% real juice.
