{'name': 'Bougainvillea', 'address': '202 State St, Ste A', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Food, Restaurants, Beer, Wine & Spirits, Italian, Pizza', 'hours': {'Monday': '11:0-10:0', 'Tuesday': '11:0-10:0', 'Wednesday': '11:0-10:0', 'Thursday': '11:0-10:0', 'Friday': '11:0-10:0', 'Saturday': '11:0-10:0', 'Sunday': '11:0-10:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': False, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': True, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2009-05-31 00:18:23', 'review_text': 'what a bummer!!! I was so excited to have dinner here and there are huge "for rent" signs in the windows. It will be missed.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2008-08-26 03:30:05', 'review_text': 'My husband and I went here tonight and the food and service was excellent.  He had the deep dish barbecue pizza and I had the ravioli.  The food was delicious.  The service was also very accommodating.  We highly recommend this place.'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2008-05-29 04:33:08', 'review_text': "Atmosphere is very nice here! They have a semi-separate area with a fire place that was great for an anniversary celebration with my girl. Wine list is decent but I felt they didn't offer enough wines by the glass. Food was just good (7 out of 10). She had the Salmon special of the day which was average. I had the Chicken Vesuvio which I really liked. I wanted to try the local wines so I had the Santa Barbara Syrah and she had the S.B. Chardonnay. Both were reasonably priced and well worth it!

Total for the night was $65 for two entrees, two glasses of wine, and Tiramisu (which was excellent).

Highly recommended for a nice place to have dinner. Would've been 5 stars if the food was better."}]}

{'name': 'Baba Small Batch', 'address': '103 Sant Felicia Dr', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Food, Restaurants, Mediterranean, Farmers Market, Specialty Food, Organic Stores, Street Vendors', 'hours': {'Monday': '8:0-16:0', 'Tuesday': '8:0-16:0', 'Wednesday': '8:0-16:0', 'Thursday': '8:0-16:0', 'Friday': '8:0-17:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': None, 'RestaurantsReservations': None, 'OutdoorSeating': None, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': None, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2020-04-04 19:13:09', 'review_text': "OK, to be honest, I stopped by the Baba stand at the Morro Bay farmers market, not because of the hummus. It was because of the wonderful red-headed gal that was working your booth. She turned out to be charming, helpful and informative. I had never tried hummus before. She explained it to me and helped me choose just the right one. I ended up buying 2 the first week and many more since then. Last week she talked me into trying the bread and I'm glad she did. I love her and I love your product.
Employees like her are hard to find. (I'm really bad with names or I would add it)"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2018-08-31 07:15:44', 'review_text': "This has to be the best hummus I've ever had and the chips are an added bonus!! They have so many hummus flavors to choose from. Seriously this stuff is compared to drugs. Once you have a taste it, you can't stop. Haha. For the past few years they would make their way up to Fresno's River Park Farmers Market. But sad to say, they didn't come up this year. I'm sure everyone who bought their hummus here in town was saddened when  Baba's hummus didn't make an appearance. I know my family and I were sad. 

I hope I find their hummus when I go to SLO next weekend. If the owner is reading this, please come back to Fresno and sell your amazing hummus!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2017-07-07 05:28:45', 'review_text': "The baba spicy pepper with Harrisa is soooo good! It's a bit spicy so try it before you buy if you can't handle heat. But if you can give it a go. It's amazing."}]}

{'name': 'Panino', 'address': '5666 Calle Real', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Sandwiches, Delis, Restaurants, Soup, Salad, Food', 'hours': {'Monday': '10:0-16:0', 'Tuesday': '10:0-16:0', 'Wednesday': '10:0-16:0', 'Thursday': '10:0-16:0', 'Friday': '10:0-16:0', 'Saturday': '10:0-16:0', 'Sunday': '11:0-15:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'no', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'classy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 3.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-04-22 19:38:05', 'review_text': "Okay, this was not exactly what I expected, but its a delightful surprise!! I decided to try something new and go with the English Stilton and pear sandwich today...I don't know why, but I assumed the cranberries and walnuts would be in a kind of chutney so when I opened my sandwich I was kind of disappointed until I took a bite. HOLY COW ITS DELICIOUS! Everyone should try this sandwich on Foccacia bread!

Classic faves of mine also include the Turkey and Salami, Cobb Salad Sandwich, and Caprese Sandwich. I've honestly never had anything that I didn't like. Thanks for another delicious lunch today, Panino!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-01-27 23:52:51', 'review_text': 'A couple of months ago my wife and I had to do some business in Goleta. When we were done we asked where we could get a good sandwich. They recommended Panino. It was great!! Today my wife and I were bored from staying at home cause of the pandemic. We decided to take a drive to Goleta and have lunch at Panino. Again, our sandwiches/lunch were great. Very friendly and good service. Take it from us who drive all the way from Oxnard. Highly recommended!!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2020-12-04 04:09:52', 'review_text': "Depending on my taste buds for the day, Panino has either the best or the 2nd best sandwich in town. That would be the Italian combo on focaccia. Layered with fine meats and cheeses, it's thoughtfully complemented by a delightful basil aioli, lettuce, and thin cut green bell pepper and cucumber. If one maneuvers the meat and cheese correctly, every bite has the most appealing ratio of ingredients you will ever taste in a sandwich. It's like taking a bite out of the Sistine Chapel, or being able to taste the Mona Lisa. If they ever change it, I will seriously write a strongly worded letter to management. 

If I ever were to try any of their other sandwiches, I'm assuming they would also be delicious. The prices are a bit more than average, much as the price of a Lakers ticket costs more than one for the Clippers."}]}

{'name': 'Haggen Food & Pharmacy', 'address': '175 N Fairview Ave', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Delis, Drugstores, Restaurants, Food, Shopping, Grocery, Bakeries', 'hours': {'Monday': '6:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '6:0-0:0', 'Wednesday': '6:0-0:0', 'Thursday': '6:0-0:0', 'Friday': '6:0-0:0', 'Saturday': '6:0-0:0', 'Sunday': '6:0-0:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': False, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': True, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'no', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'classy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'touristy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': False}}, 'business_stars': 2.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2015-11-02 06:05:33', 'review_text': "Went in after the change from Vons for some whole wheat flour and was surprised that the flour was over $8 for 5 pounds. Next time I went to Smart and final and the King Arthur flour is $3.99 regular price. I live in Goleta so next time I went back to Haggens to compare and they had the King Arthur flour for $6.49 with 20% off which is still $5.15. I have been shopping in the same store since the Safeway opened in the 60's but I am done now with this kind of price increase."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2015-10-26 10:12:53', 'review_text': 'I decided to give this Haggen location a chance. I walked into an mostly empty store. I notice some items that have been marked down in the deli due to product expiring the same day. I take it up to the register. The store manager was at the register. She refused to honor the discount on the packaging and said it was a mistake. Haggen, you can keep your expired food!'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2015-10-22 07:50:28', 'review_text': 'Really? I know you're going out of business Haggen but you expect me to pack my own groceries now? 

Now, even though I am an educated professional on a 6+ figure salary, I am not above stuffing some groceries in a shopping bag. It's obviously not difficult. However, if you want me to do your job for you, you've got to be nice to me. Last time I was in the store the portly middle aged man just threw my groceries onto the conveyer belt and left them to pile up at the end. He never acknowledged my existence except to grunt the total to me. 

You can either pack my damn groceries or I walk out next time. Not sorry you'll soon be out of a job if that's the level of "service" you provide. Pfft.'}]}

{'name': "Rusty's Pizza Parlor", 'address': '111 State St', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Pizza', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '11:0-20:0', 'Wednesday': '11:0-0:0', 'Thursday': '11:0-0:0', 'Friday': '11:0-0:0', 'Saturday': '11:0-0:0', 'Sunday': '11:0-0:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': True, 'OutdoorSeating': False, 'WiFi': 'no', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': None, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 3.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-18 19:14:33', 'review_text': 'Really good pizza, reasonable prices, nice setting, late hours, quick pickup.....'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-06 21:11:26', 'review_text': "Garbage customer service. Owner should just have a self order computer at the counter.Pizza was decent. Don't come here."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-12 01:30:37', 'review_text': "Had a homeless person in here eating, shopping cart and all. Kids are riding around indoors on electric scooters. Staff are unfriendly and unresponsive. Service is slow. 

