{'name': 'Montecito Confections', 'address': '1150 Coast Village Rd, Ste E', 'city': 'Montecito', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Bakeries, Food', 'hours': {'Monday': '9:0-17:0', 'Tuesday': '9:0-17:0', 'Wednesday': '9:0-17:0', 'Thursday': '9:0-17:0', 'Friday': '9:0-17:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': False, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': None, 'OutdoorSeating': None, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': None, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': None, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2014-08-14 04:36:40', 'review_text': 'Ordered a white cake with buttercream. When I placed the order they suggested a light lemon cream filling which I went with. It was beyond perfect. Light fluffy buttercream, moist cake, and the filling was a perfect match up. Yep, I will be back!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2014-08-07 19:34:34', 'review_text': 'Katie baked the wedding cake of my dreams. It came out exactly as I wanted and was delicious. We had three tiers: two were red velvet and one was vanilla custard cake with fresh raspberries. I am very happy with our decision to choose her.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2014-05-09 15:00:38', 'review_text': 'Katie Teall is an ANGEL!!!  I made a wedding cake for the daughter of a very close High School friend and the Fondant I bought (FondArt) was horrible.  I spent about 7 hours kneading it and rolling it, and no matter what I did when I covered a tier of the cake it cracked.  I was so stressed that decided to go to Montecito Confections to see if I could buy Fondant there.  I got there and asked Katie Teall the sweet adorable, British owner if she could help me.  she explained that she sold the store and the rest of her Fondant was for the last 15 wedding cakes that she had to deliver during the summer.  She must have seen my face of stress, exhaustion, just lost, and asked:  How big is your cake?  I told her and she said:  Do you want me to cover it in Fondant for you?  I jumped to hug her and kiss her and hug her and kissed her some more.

I came home and the mother of the bride carried the bottom tier and we went back to Montecito Confections to be saved by Katie.  We arrived and she said where is the rest of the cake?  I did not want to take advantage so we just took the biggest tier.  She said:  Bring it!

Home we went after hugging Katie and kissing her some more and got help and left with two more tiers.  Katie my angel covered the three tiers!!! She was my angel.  The mother of the bride broke in tears, I guess she was worried that I was never going to serve the wedding cake.  These were tears of relief!  We ended up having the most beautiful cake and thanks to Katie.  Katie also build the cake, putting all three tiers together.  Then explained to me how to decorate it.  She told me to get a photo of the container of her fondant because she had tried all the different brands and that was the best of them all.  She said that mine was impossible to work with since it was too dry!  Katie is a walking ANGEL.  I love her, love her and love her.  All the kisses and hugs are not enough to thank her for saving the wedding cake and so much more.'}]}

{'name': 'Oakberry Açaí Bowls and Smoothies', 'address': '819-B State St', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Coffee & Tea, Restaurants, Cafes, Food, Acai Bowls, Juice Bars & Smoothies', 'hours': {'Monday': '8:0-20:0', 'Tuesday': '8:0-20:0', 'Wednesday': '8:0-20:0', 'Thursday': '8:0-18:0', 'Friday': '9:0-20:0', 'Saturday': '8:0-20:0', 'Sunday': '8:0-20:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': None, 'RestaurantsReservations': None, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': None, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-22 19:05:43', 'review_text': "Great Açaí! We stopped here for a quick lunch and it didn't disappoint! Lots of fresh fruit available ans a great variety of toppings. Açaí was a bit thinner than other types I've had but still had great flavor. The chai pudding topping was my favorite - never had that before and it was a nice addition! Would stop by again for sure!"}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-19 00:38:41', 'review_text': 'Love this place for a quick lunch or a pick me up! There are plenty of choices for toppings and they have gluten free options. I like adding coconut, peanut butter, bananas, strawberries and granola. My reasoning for the four stars is i feel it is a little overpriced.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-19 03:30:05', 'review_text': '5 star acai bowl, service, and location.  So impressed with this last minute find.  It ended up being a light dinner kinda night for us and with not much open at almost 8pm, but these bowls hit the spot.  

Once you choose the size you want, there is a large list of toppings which are unlimited.  I chose everything that sounded good and I was so impressed with how well they all went together.  My first time having peanut butter with my acai and chai pudding but it messed well.  Fresh, flavorful and filling.  

I know where to stop now when in Santa Barbara.'}]}

{'name': 'De La Vina Lounge', 'address': '2711 De La Vina St', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Dive Bars, Bars, Lounges, Nightlife, Pool Halls, Sports Bars', 'hours': {'Monday': '10:0-2:0', 'Tuesday': '10:0-2:0', 'Wednesday': '10:0-2:0', 'Thursday': '10:0-2:0', 'Friday': '10:0-2:0', 'Saturday': '10:0-2:0', 'Sunday': '10:0-2:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': True, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': False, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': None, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': False, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': True, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-05-18 05:56:58', 'review_text': 'Alice is a saint! Loved finding this gem in Santa Barbara. Enjoy the family vibes when you enter.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-05-12 05:17:30', 'review_text': 'I really hate updating reviews.   First impressions, right??  But in the case of Jimboz, how could I not. I don't want to call myself a regular because honestly I have never been there at 10am for The Price Is Right and never make it more than once in a week.  But I will say I'm a huge fan!  I usually go on Tuesdays which is officially "Ladies Night".  But Alice is always working and treats me like her bestie!!! Nobody pours a Grand Mariner better than Alice.   What?  They do fancy???   Hell Yes!!  Premium tequilas, good Bourbon, they have it.... but most of all you feel at home, they have very welcoming regulars.   If someone is doing a food run, you will probably be included.   Isn't that what a neighborhood bar should be about??'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-04-15 23:35:01', 'review_text': 'Sometimes YOU "get what YOU pay for" & sometimes YOU get just WHAT you're looking for...!  Especially if it is that "throwback" friendly "tavern" of Ol'!  That The "dufas hipsters" like to refer as a "dive bar", because they have NO reference points in their own generation!

Anyway if YOU are looking for a small, intimate NO FRILLS, friendly lil' place to "toss back a few" w/ your friends and/or solo THIS should be on your "go to LIST"...!!!

Plenty of GOOD restaurants within in walking distance...'}]}

{'name': 'Chick-fil-A', 'address': '3707 State St', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Sandwiches, Chicken Shop, Chicken Wings, Fast Food, Caterers, Event Planning & Services', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '6:30-22:0', 'Wednesday': '6:30-22:0', 'Thursday': '6:30-22:0', 'Friday': '10:30-22:0', 'Saturday': '6:30-16:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'classy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'touristy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-04 06:14:23', 'review_text': "A top tier chick fil a that only appears once in a lifetime. Love the food and service at this location specifically. I know there are many different chick fil a's but this one in particular nails customer service. When they mess up on an order (which they rarely do) they always make sure to make it right! That's customer service which is pretty hard to find in the fast food industry."}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-22 05:05:38', 'review_text': 'Love it! Food is awesome every single time but not a big fan of the outdoor cleanliness'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-14 13:39:47', 'review_text': "Delicious as always!
Go to for fast food and the fries never disappoints.

Must try the peppermint milkshake at least once. I don't really even like milkshakes because I prefer to eat and not drink my ice cream, but this one was pretty yummy and I had multiple sips of my partners drink!"}]}

{'name': "Choi's Oriental Market", 'address': '185 S Patterson Ave, Ste D', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Food, Grocery, Korean, Restaurants, International Grocery', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '10:0-19:30', 'Wednesday': '10:0-19:30', 'Thursday': '10:0-19:30', 'Friday': '10:0-19:30', 'Saturday': '10:0-19:30'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'valet': False, 'garage': False, 'street': None, 'lot': True, 'validated': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': None, 'WiFi': 'no', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': False, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-14 22:24:32', 'review_text': "A must try in Santa Barbara! I've had soondubu many places, but this one is my favorite. I've had the bulgogi, spicy pork, soondunu, tteokmanduguk, and the tteobokki and I would recommend all of them. 

It's a small mom and pop kind of store with various Asian goods run by a husband and wife. They're always super friendly. The husband runs the front and the wife runs the kitchen. The food reminds me very much of when I would go to my korean friends' houses with that kind of home cooking.

Definitely food that warms the soul and fills you up, and for a good price too!"}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-09 04:58:28', 'review_text': 'If I could give zero stars I would.  Wanted to order something off the menu. When I walked up to the counter, the cashier - an older Asian man asked me ''what do you want?"  No pleasant greeting hello of any kind instead he was just extremely curt and lacked any type of of customer service skills.  The woman working the kitchen in the back was just as unpleasant.  I like supporting small local businesses, but the extremely rude staff at this market don't seem to care nor appreciate the business they are getting.  I will NEVER return again and will NEVER waste my time and money here!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-04 04:52:53', 'review_text': 'Great hole in the wall spot for Korean food! This place is really neat and doubles as both a restraint and a mini Korean market. We looked around the market while our food was being prepared and grabbed some ramen and calpico upon finding boReally enjoyed the bulgolgi and the sundubu. With the lack of Korean food in Santa Barbara, the food really hit home!'}]}

{'name': 'Rockfire Grill', 'address': '6583 Pardall Rd', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Chicken Wings, Sandwiches, Breakfast & Brunch, Pizza, Burgers', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '11:30-22:0', 'Wednesday': '11:30-19:0', 'Thursday': '11:30-22:0', 'Friday': '11:30-22:0', 'Saturday': '17:0-22:0', 'Sunday': '11:0-22:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': True, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-09 19:02:34', 'review_text': 'Was a nice place good food and good service . Highly recommend. Lots of tvs for sports fans and overall good vibe'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-05 05:57:43', 'review_text': 'I really like Rockfire Grill. We were coming from LA  and stopped by there to grab something to eat. We got pizza, burger, and gyros. My daughter liked the burger. I liked all the food. Our pizza was  burnt at the bottom but they gladly renewed. Great customer service'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-04 23:13:41', 'review_text': "My friend and I stopped in here to grab an outdoor dinner on a beautiful evening and we had a great experience! The patio has plenty of seating, service at the counter and efficient and our cashier gave great recommendations since we had never eaten here before. Loved the vibe, with the kind of surfy decor and a playlist that took me back to the Caribbean.

Let me start with the stars of the meal...the flatbread burger. Why aren't these a thing everywhere because they should be?! I ordered the East Bay BBQ and holy cow was it amazing. Meat was cooked to perfection, the house spread was something special, and the flatbread it came on was so good I basically have no words. My friend got the West Coast and she had the same reaction I did. We stuffed ourselves because it was so tasty. We also had chicken wings (with an absolutely delicious honey garlic sauce) and seasoned fries, both of which perfectly complemented the flatbread burgers.

I would order this whole meal again exactly the same way it was so good. Only wish we had one where I live (hint hint guys, open some more locations further down in SoCal). Already planning to take my boyfriend here next time we take a little day trip up to SB."}]}

