{'name': 'The Bak Door', 'address': '320 S Kellogg Ave', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Dive Bars, Nightlife, Bars', 'hours': None, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': False, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': None, 'OutdoorSeating': False, 'WiFi': None, 'RestaurantsTakeOut': None, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': None, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'romantic': False, 'intimate': False, 'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'divey': False, 'classy': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'casual': False}}, 'business_stars': 3.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2011-06-26 07:35:23', 'review_text': "The ultimate dive bar.  Cheap stiff drinks, pool tables, and an awesome juke box.  Don't come here to be wowed, but to relax at the place where you know everyones name."}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2010-09-19 16:07:47', 'review_text': "The Bak Dor. I'm with Anne -- refreshing to hit a dive bar that isn't asses to elbows with ironic mustaches, cutoff jeans, and topsiders. 

